  " Default values
  PERFORM sub_get_default_values.

*---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*  Dynamic Screen Handling
*---------------------------------------------------------------------*
AT SELECTION-SCREEN OUTPUT.
  " Field control
  PERFORM sub_screen_modify.

