*---------------------------------------------------------------------*
AT SELECTION-SCREEN ON VALUE-REQUEST FOR p_pres.
  " Presentation server
  PERFORM sub_f4_pres_file.

AT SELECTION-SCREEN ON VALUE-REQUEST FOR p_apps.
  " Application server
  PERFORM sub_f4_app_file.

AT SELECTION-SCREEN ON VALUE-REQUEST FOR p_dpath.
  " Download path
  PERFORM sub_f4_downpath.

*---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*  Input Validation
*---------------------------------------------------------------------*
AT SELECTION-SCREEN.
  " Validate inputs
  PERFORM sub_validate_sscreen.

*---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*  Main Execution
*---------------------------------------------------------------------*
START-OF-SELECTION  

  IF p_down IS INITIAL.
    " Data extraction
    PERFORM sub_get_data.

    IF gt_data IS NOT INITIAL.
      " File processing
      PERFORM sub_process_file.
    ENDIF.

  ELSE.
    " Template generation
    PERFORM sub_generate_template.
  ENDIF.


